# ---- Core ----
# PostgreSQL. On Vercel: add the Prisma Postgres integration with prefix "DATABASE" (creates DATABASE_URL).
# Locally: run `npm run db:dev`, then paste the postgres://… URL it prints and add &pgbouncer=true&connection_limit=1
DATABASE_URL="postgres://postgres:postgres@localhost:51214/template1?sslmode=disable&pgbouncer=true&connection_limit=1"
# long random string, e.g. `node -e "console.log(require('crypto').randomBytes(32).toString('hex'))"`
# REQUIRED in production — logins are refused until this is 32+ random characters
AUTH_SECRET="change-me-to-a-long-random-string"
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL="http://localhost:3000"

# First admin account (created on the first deploy / `npm run setup`). Use your own email and a strong password.
ADMIN_EMAIL="admin@example.com"
ADMIN_PASSWORD="ChangeMe123!"

# ---- PayPal (https://developer.paypal.com/dashboard/applications) ----
